<div id="welcome">
  <div purpose="page-container">
    <div purpose="page-content">
    <div>
    <h1>Add your device to AutoMDM</h1>
    <p>AutoMDM makes it a little easier for your IT team to keep your computer healthy without interfering with your work.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
    <p>1. Click the button below to download AutoMDM's software.</p>
    <a purpose="download-button" href="/download" target="_blank" download="automdm-installer.msi">Download</a>
    </div>
    <p>2. Double-click to open and install the software.</p>
    <p>You're done! You can confirm that your computer was added by clicking the AutoMDM icon in your system tray to open AutoMDM Desktop. There, you can see the information your organization collects from your computer.</p>
    <div purpose="logo"><img alt="AutoMDM logo" src="/images/automdm-logo-black-33-69x24@2x.png"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
